WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.380
Originally, the world was one.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.420
Then I embarked upon research to 
breathe life into Duel Monsters,

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.460
using Solid Vision.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:11.960
But...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.870
I ended up creating a devil who 
led the world to destruction.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.340
At last, I have it.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.310
I've become one with the four ultimate dragons

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:34.650
and attained the power of a god.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:39.230
As you wished,

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:43.850
I have become the embodiment 
of stronger, greater power!

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.500
Soon, the world would end

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.860
at the hands of Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.640
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:03.960
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:07.210
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:10.850
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:48.810
Revival Zero

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:53.790
Leo!

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:58.760
You said that a certain incident caused 
the single world to be split into four.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:02.250
Was this the cause? This Supreme King?

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:04.410
Yes, the Supreme King.

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:09.290
It was a monster made from combining the dragon

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:15.470
of each summoning method:
 Standard, Fusion, Synchro, and Xyz.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.310
When the monster was separated,

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:23.480
the world was also divided into dimensions, 
based on those four methods.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.810
The Supreme King was separated? You mean...

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.960
What is it?

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:34.290
Yuya Sakaki, whom we captured, 
has escaped from the Doctor's lab!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.260
What?

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.200
Yuya?

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.680
That power...

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.170
Was that really Yuya?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.970
We have no more time to lose.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.340
Bring Yuzu Hiiragi and the 
other three here at once.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:53.770
Hurry up, Doctor!

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:58.580
Yuya!

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.420
Dad...

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:02.790
Dad!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:04.890
Hey!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.860
You've grown, Yuya.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.780
Dad, I finally found you.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.760
Where have you been?

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:15.990
So much has happened since you've been gone...

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.100
Academia kidnapped Yuzu!

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.500
Yuzu?

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.680
Don't worry, Yuya.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.520
Leo, my son is crying!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.280
Please don't bring any more 
sorrow to these children!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.150
Knowing that you're a man 
of such accomplishments,

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:36.120
I'm sure you had a good reason for your actions.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:39.710
But stop involving children.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.330
Listen to me, please!

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.900
Yuya Sakaki,

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:46.670
so you've finally made it here.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.650
Yusyo...

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:54.070
Yuya there is your son, but he is not your son.

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.100
Stop talking nonsense!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.040
Professor, give back Yuzu!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.760
Give her back? You have it wrong.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:05.150
I am the one trying to take back the truth.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.780
Take back the truth?

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:17.660
Yuzu!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.260
Serena!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:22.930
Ruri!

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.890
Professor, the preparations are complete.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.840
What are you doing with them?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.650
Free them right now!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.480
Professor, leave this to me.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:43.540
This time, I will defeat Yuya Sakaki.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:48.760
He seems to be the Doctor who's been 
controlling Ruri and the others.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.230
He's the one who took Yuzu.

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:58.630
To learn what happened to the bug 
that entered Yuya Sakaki,

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:03.040
I would like to run an experiment with 
the girls implanted with the queens.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.380
Enough, Doctor.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.410
The likes of you will never defeat Yuya Sakaki.

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:10.250
"Never," you say?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:14.520
Do you assert that there is something I, 
the genius Doctor, cannot do?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.540
If I may be so insolent,

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:21.150
my mind is the greatest in all of Academia.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.290
That's shown by my ability

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:27.330
to control humans with monsters, 
something never before done.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:30.780
I developed the Fusion Parasites

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:34.430
to further investigate Real Solid Vision's potential.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:37.640
As a fellow scientist, you should understand.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:43.660
If there's a topic deserving of research, 
and you're eager to reach its natural end—

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:44.950
That's right.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.010
I once did the same thing.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:53.260
To indulge my curiosity and give 
life to Real Solid Vision.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:56.900
As a result, I aided in the birth of a devil.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.260
Your way of thinking is dangerous.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.600
Wait!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.000
Don't do it, Leo!

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:11.900
Leo...

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:13.950
Yuzu!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:20.940
Huh? What's going on?

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:23.050
Where are we?

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.040
Yuya?

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.420
Yeah, it's me!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.210
You're back to your old self?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.640
I'm so glad, Yuzu!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.130
Stay back!

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:35.930
Yuzu!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.170
Yuya! Yuya!

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:40.520
Let me out! Let me out now!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.640
We're sealed in these!

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.240
Ruri, I'll save you!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.480
What are you planning, Professor?

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.540
Good question...

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.910
You have the right to know.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.860
I want you to learn the truth and accept it.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:05.160
Supreme King Z-ARC, created in 
the formerly united world,

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:10.120
said he was born of the ceaseless human greed

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:13.830
that desired fighting and loved war.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:18.640
"Duel Monsters cards have souls."

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.340
Ignoring that ancient myth,

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:26.500
I created monsters that converted 
those black feelings into energy.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:32.620
Doing so awoke a sense of responsibility 
to create cards that could oppose them.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:37.290
Thus, in seeking a power that 
exceeded human knowledge,

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:40.170
I set my sights on the natural world's energy.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.990
Plants that still bloom with the seasons,

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:49.070
no matter how they're trampled or burned.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:53.550
Animals that endure long winters, 
to be reinvigorated in spring.

00:08:56.280 --> 00:09:00.010
They have no greed or obsession.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.320
They simply have patterns,

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:06.200
repeated for thousands... hundreds of 
thousands... millions of years.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.990
If I could infuse cards with that powerful energy,

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:17.300
they could easily counter Supreme King Z-ARC, 
empowered by humanity's black desires.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.360
With that certainty, I used the crude devices

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.300
at my disposal to produce four cards.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:28.750
I was preparing

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:32.700
to use them to face Z-ARC when...

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.260
They were stolen? By whom?

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.090
The one who stole the four cards

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:45.230
was my daughter, Ray, 
who was also a pro duelist.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.400
Daughter?

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.930
You have a daughter?

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.900
I pursued her as fast as I could.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:57.680
Stay back! The future needs you, Father!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.850
What are you saying, Ray?

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:03.210
Young people like you are what the future needs.

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:09.070
I must trade my life to destroy the devil I created,

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.700
so that you can live in peace—

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:13.280
I don't want to lose you, Father.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:27.900
Ray!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:57.840
No...

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:59.050
Don't do this, Ray!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.610
This is...

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.520
Inside that field, Ray is trying to draw 
all the natural world's energies,

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:11.080
collected by the cards, into her body...

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.540
Don't do this!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.920
Ray, if you do this, you'll...

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:25.880
Damn you! Damn you!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.130
You'll pay...

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:36.730
You'll pay for splitting us after we became one!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:50.620
The next thing I knew, I was 
in an unfamiliar city.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.120
My turn!

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.430
I won't lose!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:04.230
There, they were fighting Standard Duels,

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:07.370
without Fusion, Synchro, or Xyz Summons.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:11.080
What are you doing, mister?

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:15.470
You know you can't touch that. 
It's Solid Vision.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:16.890
Solid Vision?

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:18.250
You don't know about it?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.820
It's the latest in holographic technology!

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.940
I didn't know who I was...

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:30.910
But unconsciously, I retained my 
knowledge as an engineer.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.370
Propelled by something,

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:37.230
I worked to improve that 
primitive Solid Vision System.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.030
Soon, I had evolved it into 
Solid Vision with mass,

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.020
the Real Solid Vision System.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.690
Yusyo, that was just around 
the time that I met you.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.600
I see.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:54.750
Real Solid Vision technology already existed.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.190
If what you're saying is the truth...

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:59.390
It's all true.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:05.400
The world was once united, 
and I created that devil.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:09.580
And my daughter, Ray, 
sacrificed herself to split it.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:12.980
As a result, the world was divided into four!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.610
Is that...

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.810
...really true?

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.780
I learned everything

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:25.600
when I investigated how I could 
remember the future,

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:29.720
and my original memories 
began to gradually return.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.860
Then I became possessed by one single thought.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:40.970
If I were alive, then Ray, who was also there,

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:45.180
could still be alive, somewhere among 
the four divided dimensions.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:57.930
That's right.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.440
Without concern for my mother or me,

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.090
you lost yourself in that incomprehensible research!

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:06.660
That was when it started.

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:09.330
That's when Mom changed.

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:19.740
I wanted you to pay for making her unhappy.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:24.210
I wanted to learn what you were 
doing and to punish you for it.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:31.420
That was when you arrived...

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.520
Here, at the Fusion Dimension's Academia.

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:37.850
Yes.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.450
And that's when I learned

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:44.500
that you were trying to use Academia 
as a base to begin military invasions!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:49.720
I did not join Academia to start military invasions!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.970
Then, why?!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.740
I told you.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.310
Because I believed that Ray had survived.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:04.400
I searched all four dimensions 
for any trace of Ray.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.400
And at last, I found her

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.850
here, at Academia!

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.190
You found Ray?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.130
Serena?

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:20.770
What?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.870
Serena is Ray?

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:29.460
Yes. Serena was identical to Ray as a child.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.270
She was younger than Ray,

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:37.440
but when I saw the bracelet she wore, 
I knew it for sure.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:43.050
Because it looked so much like the one that 
appeared when Ray separated Z-ARC.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:48.620
But no matter what I tried, Serena had 
none of Ray's memories.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.610
Why not?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:55.130
As I stewed over the question, a sight 
replayed in the back of my mind.

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:03.370
Back then, Ray's and the Supreme 
King's shadows both split into four.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:07.360
Tearing apart the Supreme King 
had rent the dimensions,

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.040
and scars were left on Ray, as well.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.700
Was it possible that Ray had 
been split into four parts,

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.960
reborn with new life into each 
of the four dimensions?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.660
Split among the four dimensions?

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:24.780
Can it be? Yuzu's...

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.430
Yuzu's a reincarnation of Ray, too?

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.470
Exactly.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:35.470
Yuzu was the Standard Dimension's 
reincarnation of Ray.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:38.810
Serena was her reincarnation 
in the Fusion Dimension.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:41.280
In the Xyz Dimension, it was Ruri.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:44.220
And in the Synchro Dimension, it was Rin.

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:50.520
Ray had been reborn in each 
of the four dimensions.

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:57.020
My desire was to unite the four into one,

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:59.830
reviving my daughter, Ray!

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.430
Reviving?

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:06.270
The Aquaria Project was designed 
to make that happen.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:12.320
By sending duelists, strengthened at 
Duel Academia, to other dimensions

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:15.310
to collect people who'd become cards,

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:21.880
I could use the coagulated life energy to restore 
and unify the world from the four dimensions.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.490
And Ray, as well.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:25.920
Impossible!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:30.730
How will turning people into cards and 
collecting them restore the world?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.860
How will it restore Ray?!

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:36.710
Look... Here is my answer!

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:55.820
Is that...

00:17:56.370 --> 00:18:00.540
It's a device I created to revive the world.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:04.470
The fifth dimension, ARC-V, is being born inside.

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.560
ARC-V?

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:11.900
When the life energy reaches the 
requisite amount, ARC-V will activate,

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:16.770
and the Standard, Fusion, Synchro, 
and Xyz Dimensions

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:22.510
will be liberated from their unnatural 
split, regaining their original state.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:28.250
At the same time, Ray's four doppelgangers 
— Yuzu, Serena, Ruri, and Rin —

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:32.320
will become one within ARC-V, 
being reborn as Ray!

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:35.660
This will be a new beginning. In other words,

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.300
Revival Zero!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.420
We will become one?

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:44.940
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:51.900
Each of those falling cards is 
someone from Heartland...

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:55.350
No... I won't let that happen!

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.000
Revival Zero.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.160
Then, it refers to Ray's revival.

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:10.940
In that file, next to Serena's name, 
Joeri's name appeared.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:15.880
If Serena is the Fusion reincarnation of Ray,

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:16.870
what of Joeri?

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.800
It can't be.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.670
Yuya is...

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.280
Reiji, help me.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:29.120
Defeat Yuya Sakaki with me now!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.080
Defeat Yuya?

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.790
As an intelligent young man, 
you must have already figured it out.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.920
Just as Ray was split into four and 
reincarnated in each dimension,

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:43.830
Z-ARC, too, was reincarnated in 
each of the four dimensions.

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:47.800
He, Yuya Sakaki, is Z-ARC's reincarnation!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:52.900
Only a duel can seal Z-ARC, who wields 
the power of Duel Monsters.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:58.330
Defeat the devil duelist who took 
the world to destruction's brink

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:01.350
and forced your sister, Ray, 
to sacrifice herself to split them!

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.450
We're pieces of that devil?

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.340
You're lying... Yuya would never do that!

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:09.050
It simply isn't possible.

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:11.660
You two must know this, as well.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.660
Yuya Sakaki has already increased 
his power by fusing

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:18.040
with his Xyz Dimension double.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.460
You have seen his destructive power.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:28.910
To stop that devil's rebirth, we need 
to crush him while we still can!

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:32.140
No! I'm not a devil!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.220
I just want

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:37.240
to use duels to bring everyone smiles!

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.090
I know.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.960
Your duels are about entertainment.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.330
Reiji...

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.600
And I have seen all the people that

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:55.600
your duels have made smile.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:02.510
Yuya also stopped the Academia Army's 
conquest of the Xyz Dimension

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.880
by moving their hearts.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.880
There can be no peace among the 
four dimensions without him!

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:12.570
You are the one disrupting their peace!

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:17.740
Uniting the world by putting 
fear in their hearts is wrong!

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:23.290
As leader of the Lancers, I will 
see my convictions through!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.190
I will stop Leo Akaba's intrigues.

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:29.970
And I will do it with Yuya Sakaki!

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:32.060
Fool.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:37.070
Why can you not see that your convictions 
will drive the world to destruction again?!

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:45.080
I see that speech will do me no good.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:49.690
To restore the worlds to one, and to revive Ray,

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:52.570
I must destroy Yuya Sakaki myself.

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:54.660
Don't try to stop me, Reiji!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.860
Field Spell Crossover.

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:07.770
Duel!

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:53.180
That evil thing that lives deep in our hearts...

00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:55.150
That must be Z-ARC!

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:58.000
Which means that, unless we 
lose ourselves to anger,

00:23:58.000 --> 00:23:59.560
Z-ARC won't revive.

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:02.550
We must stop that machine and save the girls!

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:05.420
You, who made Yuzu and the others suffer...

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:08.890
I will make you, and you alone, pay!

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:15.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Decisive Battle! Spirit Tech Force.

00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:17.400
The fun is only getting started!
